//策略：SwingHigh突破 + 200EMA順勢 + 成交量過濾 + 吊燈跟蹤止損 + 時間過濾 + 固定最大停損
Inputs:
    EMA_Length(200),
    SwingLookback(3),        // 已同步新版參數
    ChandelierATR(3.5),      // 已同步新版參數
    ATR_Length(14),
    VolLength(20),          // 平均成交量週期
    StartTime(0935),        // 允許下單起始時間 (09:35)
    EndTime(1045),          // 允許下單截止時間 (10:45 前)
    MaxLossAmount(1500),    // 新增：最大允許虧損金額 (HKD)
    PointValue(10);         // 新增：每點價值 (小恒指 MHI 為 10，大恒指 HSI 為 50)

Variables:
    EMA200(0),
    SwingHighVal(0),
    ATRval(0),
    ChandelierStop(0),
    MaxStopPrice(0),        // 新增：固定最大停損價位
    ActualStopPrice(0),     // 新增：最終採用的止損價位 (取吊燈止損與最大止損較高者)
    GotNewSwingHigh(false),
    SignalToEnter(false),
    EntryHigh(0),
    AvgVol(0),              // 平均成交量
    InTimeWindow(false),    // 是否在允許交易的時間視窗內
    MaxStopPts(0);          // 新增：最大允許虧損點數

// 0. 計算最大允許虧損點數
MaxStopPts = MaxLossAmount / PointValue; // 1500 / 10 = 150 點

// 1. 200 EMA
EMA200 = XAverage(Close, EMA_Length);

// 2. 平均成交量
AvgVol = XAverage(Ticks, VolLength);

// 3. 時間區間過濾判斷 (>= 09:35 且 < 10:45)
InTimeWindow = (Time >= StartTime AND Time < EndTime);

// 4. Swing High 判斷：左右各3支K做確認 (可根據 SwingLookback 調整)
GotNewSwingHigh = High[3] > High[4] AND High[3] > High[5] AND High[3] > High[2] AND High[3] > High[1] AND High[3] > High[0];

if GotNewSwingHigh then
begin
    SwingHighVal = High[3]; // 儲存已確認的 Swing High 價位
end;

// 5. ATR
ATRval = AvgTrueRange(ATR_Length);

//==== 吊燈跟蹤止損與硬停損計算 ====
if MarketPosition = 1 then
begin
    if High > EntryHigh then
    begin
        EntryHigh = High;
    end;
    
    // 吊燈追蹤止損價位
    ChandelierStop = EntryHigh - ChandelierATR * ATRval;
    
    // 最終止損價位：取「吊燈追蹤止損」與「最大硬停損價」之中較高的價位（給予資金最高保護）
    if ChandelierStop > MaxStopPrice then
        ActualStopPrice = ChandelierStop
    else
        ActualStopPrice = MaxStopPrice;
end;

//==== 入場訊號 ====
if High > SwingHighVal AND Close > EMA200 AND Ticks > AvgVol AND MarketPosition = 0 AND SwingHighVal > 0 AND InTimeWindow then
begin
    SignalToEnter = true;
end
else
begin
    if MarketPosition <> 0 then SignalToEnter = false;
end;

// 執行入場
if SignalToEnter = true AND MarketPosition = 0 then
begin
    Buy("LongSwingBreak") 1 contracts this bar;
    EntryHigh = High;
    ChandelierStop = EntryHigh - ChandelierATR * ATRval;
    MaxStopPrice = EntryPrice - MaxStopPts; // 設定固定最大停損價位 (進場價 - 150點)
    SignalToEnter = false;
end;

// 執行止損離場 (觸發吊燈止損或最大硬停損)
if MarketPosition = 1 AND Low < ActualStopPrice then
begin
    Sell("ExitStop") 1 contracts this bar;
end;
